The largest savefile here is 173k - there are a lot, so I am fairly
confident that approaches the largest sensibly possible. "superdav" may
not have to worry too much about his disc filling up.

However, I would suggest that allowing anyone to continue an anonymous
game would be best. "Save your game and you might get to continue it if
you get back before anyone else" is surely better than "save your game and
it is definitely lost". Better yet, the user could be told the username
and password, but abandoned anon savefiles would then be put up for
general consumption after a few weeks.
